<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 209 V AUSTRALIA 10-1 - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 209 V AUSTRALIA 10-1 - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 10 for the loss of one wicket after dismissing South Africa for 209 in their first innings on the first day of the second test on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: South Africa 209 (Brian McMillan 55, Jason Gillespie 5-54); Australia 10-1.</p>
